1
00:01:42,820 --> 00:01:48,000
[When I Meet The Moon]

2
00:01:48,030 --> 00:01:51,009
[Episode 13]

3
00:01:54,770 --> 00:01:55,770
When we analyze

4
00:01:56,070 --> 00:01:57,650
these static relationships,

5
00:01:57,650 --> 00:01:58,710
we can make some assumptions.

6
00:01:58,710 --> 00:01:59,710
For example, it is

7
00:02:00,180 --> 00:02:02,310
a non-linear input factor.

8
00:02:02,680 --> 00:02:03,710
All inputs

9
00:02:03,870 --> 00:02:05,120
are non-linear.

10
00:02:05,350 --> 00:02:06,750
The input relationships

11
00:02:06,780 --> 00:02:07,920
are all linear.

12
00:02:14,430 --> 00:02:14,870
Look.

13
00:02:15,030 --> 00:02:16,160
Who is that outside?

14
00:02:16,190 --> 00:02:17,780
He's so handsome.

15
00:02:20,220 --> 00:02:21,130
That's all

16
00:02:21,310 --> 00:02:22,370
for today's class.

17
00:02:22,560 --> 00:02:24,020
Go back and review well.

18
00:02:24,150 --> 00:02:25,150
If you have any questions,

19
00:02:25,150 --> 00:02:26,060
ask me anytime.

20
00:02:26,210 --> 00:02:26,750
Okay.

21
00:02:27,870 --> 00:02:28,620
Let's go.

22
00:02:30,800 --> 00:02:32,810
Hey, class is over.

23
00:02:42,250 --> 00:02:43,380
Shize, you're here.

24
00:02:44,310 --> 00:02:45,170
Professor Che,

25
00:02:45,560 --> 00:02:46,960
how have you been lately?

26
00:02:47,910 --> 00:02:48,860
I'm doing great.

27
00:02:49,610 --> 00:02:50,470
What about you?

28
00:02:51,250 --> 00:02:52,110
How are you now?

29
00:02:54,100 --> 00:02:54,910
I'm...

30
00:02:55,750 --> 00:02:56,620
doing fine.

31
00:02:56,910 --> 00:02:57,710
Yeah.

32
00:02:58,420 --> 00:03:00,150
Compared to the last time I saw you,

33
00:03:00,150 --> 00:03:01,350
you look much better.

34
00:03:02,810 --> 00:03:04,710
Your mom came to see me a while ago,

35
00:03:05,470 --> 00:03:08,070
saying you still haven't planned
to come back.

36
00:03:13,280 --> 00:03:14,020
I'm currently working

37
00:03:14,020 --> 00:03:15,480
at a VR experience center.

38
00:03:15,520 --> 00:03:16,380
I came this time

39
00:03:16,680 --> 00:03:17,360
to promote

40
00:03:17,360 --> 00:03:18,520
the new equipment.

41
00:03:19,360 --> 00:03:21,460
Working at an experience center
is more interesting

42
00:03:21,460 --> 00:03:22,660
than staying in a lab.

43
00:03:24,620 --> 00:03:25,860
That's not bad either.

44
00:03:25,860 --> 00:03:27,370
At least, you still have

45
00:03:27,370 --> 00:03:29,430
some connection with this industry.

46
00:03:31,620 --> 00:03:32,410
Shize.

47
00:03:34,160 --> 00:03:35,260
I know you are

48
00:03:35,960 --> 00:03:37,650
a good kid with a sense of loyalty.

49
00:03:37,650 --> 00:03:39,750
It's rare for you to come back and see me.

50
00:03:39,750 --> 00:03:40,710
I'm quite happy.

51
00:03:41,530 --> 00:03:43,000
The school's lab has been

52
00:03:43,150 --> 00:03:44,350
renovated this year.

53
00:03:44,460 --> 00:03:46,210
We've added a lot of new equipment.

54
00:03:46,210 --> 00:03:48,350
The conditions
are much better than before.

55
00:03:48,350 --> 00:03:49,280
If you have time,

56
00:03:49,780 --> 00:03:50,980
you can go take a look.

57
00:03:52,630 --> 00:03:53,750
This year, the School of Control Science
and Engineering

58
00:03:53,750 --> 00:03:55,160
enrolled many students.

59
00:03:55,460 --> 00:03:56,250
However,

60
00:03:56,920 --> 00:03:57,800
there's still no one

61
00:03:57,800 --> 00:03:58,690
who can continue

62
00:03:58,690 --> 00:04:00,550
your intelligent robot project.

63
00:04:00,870 --> 00:04:01,930
It's a bit of a pity.

64
00:04:03,470 --> 00:04:04,520
I often think

65
00:04:05,650 --> 00:04:07,510
it would be great if you were here.

66
00:04:10,370 --> 00:04:11,700
I've disappointed you.

67
00:04:12,460 --> 00:04:13,880
Disappointed about what?

68
00:04:13,880 --> 00:04:14,690
Shize.

69
00:04:15,470 --> 00:04:16,370
I have never

70
00:04:16,560 --> 00:04:18,019
been disappointed in you.

71
00:04:19,060 --> 00:04:21,660
You shouldn't be disappointed
in yourself either.

72
00:04:21,660 --> 00:04:23,250
You are my most outstanding student.

73
00:04:23,250 --> 00:04:24,220
No matter where you are,

74
00:04:24,220 --> 00:04:25,010
I believe

75
00:04:25,010 --> 00:04:26,120
you can do well.

76
00:04:27,890 --> 00:04:29,890
Come visit often when you have time.

77
00:04:31,220 --> 00:04:32,750
I'll leave you to your work.

78
00:05:17,250 --> 00:05:18,060
Shize?

79
00:05:19,370 --> 00:05:20,300
Why are you here?

80
00:05:21,370 --> 00:05:22,160
Have you collected all of

81
00:05:22,160 --> 00:05:23,620
today's experiment data?

82
00:05:24,400 --> 00:05:25,690
I'm just one step away

83
00:05:25,720 --> 00:05:26,980
from completing that.

84
00:05:27,070 --> 00:05:28,270
I have to go there now.

85
00:05:29,620 --> 00:05:30,950
That's impressive!

86
00:05:34,480 --> 00:05:35,070
Yuan.

87
00:05:36,560 --> 00:05:38,360
You haven't taken your medicine

88
00:05:38,490 --> 00:05:39,590
today, have you?

89
00:05:43,270 --> 00:05:44,270
I almost forgot.

90
00:06:02,060 --> 00:06:03,060
I'll talk to you after class.

91
00:06:03,060 --> 00:06:03,600
Okay.

92
00:06:39,960 --> 00:06:40,930
[Innovation Pioneer,
Excellent Patent Award]

93
00:06:40,930 --> 00:06:41,900
[Automation] [Fu Shize]

94
00:06:51,159 --> 00:06:51,810
Excuse me.

95
00:06:53,080 --> 00:06:54,540
Which school are you from?

96
00:06:54,750 --> 00:06:55,570
How do you know

97
00:06:55,570 --> 00:06:56,970
I'm not from this school?

98
00:06:57,250 --> 00:06:58,659
I've been here for 8 years,

99
00:06:58,659 --> 00:07:00,190
from freshman to 5th-year PhD.

100
00:07:00,190 --> 00:07:00,740
I remember every girl

101
00:07:00,740 --> 00:07:02,180
clearly.

102
00:07:02,540 --> 00:07:03,740
Especially a beauty

103
00:07:03,740 --> 00:07:04,480
like you.

104
00:07:04,750 --> 00:07:05,800
I'm Chen Lirong.

105
00:07:06,500 --> 00:07:07,600
Shall we add each other on WeChat?

106
00:07:07,600 --> 00:07:08,430
No, thanks.

107
00:07:08,660 --> 00:07:09,450
Don't be shy.

108
00:07:09,450 --> 00:07:10,130
We can be friends.

109
00:07:10,130 --> 00:07:11,450
I have a boyfriend.

110
00:07:11,950 --> 00:07:12,950
Really?

111
00:07:14,070 --> 00:07:15,160
I-It's him.

112
00:07:15,810 --> 00:07:16,820
Fu Shize?

113
00:07:18,800 --> 00:07:19,570
What's wrong?

114
00:07:19,570 --> 00:07:22,030
He's been on leave of absence
for over a year.

115
00:07:22,480 --> 00:07:23,330
If you want to reject me,

116
00:07:23,330 --> 00:07:25,120
find a better excuse.

117
00:07:27,910 --> 00:07:28,690
Hey!

118
00:07:36,380 --> 00:07:37,880
Is it really him?

119
00:07:47,330 --> 00:07:48,000
Delicious.

120
00:08:20,870 --> 00:08:22,010
What is she doing?

121
00:08:31,040 --> 00:08:32,100
What are you doing?

122
00:08:39,820 --> 00:08:40,620
Gosh,

123
00:08:40,740 --> 00:08:41,940
is your head made of stone?

124
00:08:41,940 --> 00:08:42,669
I haven't even screamed yet.

125
00:08:42,669 --> 00:08:44,000
Why were you screaming?

126
00:08:44,080 --> 00:08:44,840
You're the one slacking off

127
00:08:44,840 --> 00:08:46,240
and sleeping here, okay?

128
00:08:46,370 --> 00:08:47,230
What about you?

129
00:08:47,580 --> 00:08:48,320
Your leg is broken,

130
00:08:48,320 --> 00:08:50,010
and you're still wandering around.

131
00:08:50,010 --> 00:08:50,870
My mobility's limited,

132
00:08:50,870 --> 00:08:51,720
but not my spirit.

133
00:08:51,720 --> 00:08:52,980
And you were slacking off here.

134
00:08:52,980 --> 00:08:54,370
I saw it clearly.

135
00:08:54,530 --> 00:08:56,270
Don't look for trouble.

136
00:08:56,340 --> 00:08:57,370
Who's looking for trouble?

137
00:08:57,370 --> 00:08:58,170
You.

138
00:08:58,480 --> 00:09:00,080
What were you doing just now?

139
00:09:00,180 --> 00:09:01,310
Trying to ambush me?

140
00:09:01,510 --> 00:09:02,340
You're overthinking.

141
00:09:02,340 --> 00:09:03,170
You were lying there

142
00:09:03,170 --> 00:09:03,770
with your mouth pouting

143
00:09:03,770 --> 00:09:04,720
like a fish.

144
00:09:04,720 --> 00:09:05,910
I thought you were going to take the bait.

145
00:09:05,910 --> 00:09:06,390
You...

146
00:09:07,270 --> 00:09:08,800
I won't stoop to your level!

147
00:09:15,960 --> 00:09:16,480
Hello?

148
00:09:16,650 --> 00:09:17,360
Zhengchu.

149
00:09:17,770 --> 00:09:18,720
I found the person

150
00:09:18,720 --> 00:09:20,120
you asked me to look into.

151
00:09:20,270 --> 00:09:21,170
What's her name?

152
00:09:21,170 --> 00:09:22,720
She has many alt accounts

153
00:09:22,720 --> 00:09:23,780
and a main account.

154
00:09:23,820 --> 00:09:25,270
The main account has many followers.

155
00:09:25,270 --> 00:09:26,470
She's an influencer.

156
00:09:26,770 --> 00:09:27,580
Who is it?

157
00:09:27,920 --> 00:09:29,250
Fairy Feifei.

158
00:09:29,770 --> 00:09:31,250
Du Gefei?

159
00:09:52,480 --> 00:09:54,280
Have you been waiting here long?

160
00:09:54,440 --> 00:09:55,130
Yeah,

161
00:09:55,880 --> 00:09:57,140
but not too long.

162
00:09:57,440 --> 00:09:59,220
You didn't come out too late.

163
00:10:02,910 --> 00:10:03,980
I came because you left your wallet

164
00:10:03,980 --> 00:10:05,030
in the car.

165
00:10:05,630 --> 00:10:07,060
I was worried you might need it urgently,

166
00:10:07,060 --> 00:10:08,050
and I didn't know where you were,

167
00:10:08,050 --> 00:10:09,530
so I came here to wait for you.

168
00:10:09,530 --> 00:10:11,480
I called you a few times,

169
00:10:11,780 --> 00:10:12,810
but you didn't answer.

170
00:10:12,810 --> 00:10:14,140
You must have been busy.

171
00:10:16,010 --> 00:10:16,820
Thank you.

172
00:10:17,410 --> 00:10:18,340
You're welcome.

173
00:10:21,630 --> 00:10:22,290
You...

174
00:10:22,390 --> 00:10:23,850
It's getting pretty late.

175
00:10:24,120 --> 00:10:25,650
If you don't have any plans,

176
00:10:25,940 --> 00:10:27,940
do you want to grab dinner together?

177
00:10:33,410 --> 00:10:34,220
No, thanks.

178
00:10:35,370 --> 00:10:36,560
I'm heading back to the hotel.

179
00:10:36,560 --> 00:10:37,960
Let me drive you.

180
00:10:45,010 --> 00:10:47,220
Or I can wait for a taxi with you

181
00:10:47,340 --> 00:10:48,530
and see you off.

182
00:10:49,910 --> 00:10:50,980
It's raining,

183
00:10:50,980 --> 00:10:52,410
and you don't have an umbrella.

184
00:10:52,410 --> 00:10:53,760
It's not good to get wet.

185
00:10:59,320 --> 00:11:00,650
I'll help you get a taxi.

186
00:11:09,320 --> 00:11:11,580
Don't think I have any other intentions.

187
00:11:16,220 --> 00:11:17,670
I haven't got a taxi yet.

188
00:11:17,940 --> 00:11:19,800
It's hard to get one on a rainy day.

189
00:11:19,940 --> 00:11:20,840
What about you?

190
00:11:30,120 --> 00:11:31,520
I can't get a taxi either.

191
00:11:32,410 --> 00:11:33,910
How about I take you back?

192
00:11:34,380 --> 00:11:35,160
If I take you back,

193
00:11:35,160 --> 00:11:36,760
it's only a 10-minute drive.

194
00:11:37,980 --> 00:11:39,440
Both professionally and personally,

195
00:11:39,440 --> 00:11:41,130
I just hope you get back early.

196
00:11:45,000 --> 00:11:46,200
Give me the umbrella.

197
00:12:40,440 --> 00:12:41,270
Did you bring

198
00:12:41,270 --> 00:12:42,800
the VR equipment this time?

199
00:12:43,670 --> 00:12:44,480
Yes, I did.

200
00:12:45,630 --> 00:12:46,460
Ms. Fang asked me to shoot

201
00:12:46,460 --> 00:12:46,940
EAW

202
00:12:46,940 --> 00:12:48,220
for EAW.

203
00:12:48,440 --> 00:12:49,970
I want my brother to be in it.

204
00:12:50,270 --> 00:12:52,270
Can I borrow it from you tomorrow?

205
00:12:54,630 --> 00:12:56,310
When you arrive later,

206
00:12:56,340 --> 00:12:58,030
just give it to me when you get off.

207
00:12:58,030 --> 00:13:00,170
I'll return it to you
at XUST the day after tomorrow.

208
00:13:00,170 --> 00:13:01,970
You don't need to come tomorrow.

209
00:13:04,530 --> 00:13:05,270
I brought

210
00:13:05,270 --> 00:13:06,890
the latest equipment this time.

211
00:13:06,890 --> 00:13:08,690
You don't know how to operate it.

212
00:13:11,630 --> 00:13:12,720
Never mind then.

213
00:13:27,980 --> 00:13:29,110
What time tomorrow?

214
00:13:33,390 --> 00:13:34,520
Ten o'clock is fine.

215
00:13:35,480 --> 00:13:36,790
I can come pick you up,

216
00:13:37,290 --> 00:13:39,150
or you can tell me when you arrive.

217
00:13:43,120 --> 00:13:43,910
It's okay.

218
00:13:44,480 --> 00:13:45,680
I'll go there myself.

219
00:13:46,270 --> 00:13:46,860
Okay.

220
00:14:13,910 --> 00:14:15,310
Too flashy.

221
00:14:21,320 --> 00:14:22,320
Too plain.

222
00:14:22,320 --> 00:14:23,980
Looks like I'm going to work.

223
00:14:25,010 --> 00:14:26,610
Though, it's all for my work.

224
00:14:31,790 --> 00:14:32,500
Li,

225
00:14:32,770 --> 00:14:33,830
what are you doing?

226
00:14:34,360 --> 00:14:35,690
You're being so sneaky.

227
00:14:37,460 --> 00:14:38,080
If I didn't know better,

228
00:14:38,080 --> 00:14:39,620
I'd think we had a burglar.

229
00:14:39,620 --> 00:14:41,120
I'm hanging up clothes.

230
00:14:41,250 --> 00:14:42,480
Hanging up clothes,

231
00:14:42,480 --> 00:14:44,170
or going on a blind date tomorrow?

232
00:14:44,170 --> 00:14:45,080
What nonsense are you talking about?

233
00:14:45,080 --> 00:14:45,620
Can you talk to me

234
00:14:45,620 --> 00:14:47,220
about your studies for once?

235
00:14:47,870 --> 00:14:49,070
Why are you in my room?

236
00:14:49,360 --> 00:14:50,080
What's up?

237
00:14:50,720 --> 00:14:51,340
Li,

238
00:14:51,430 --> 00:14:53,170
I specially heated some milk for you.

239
00:14:53,170 --> 00:14:54,500
Drink it while it's hot.

240
00:14:58,080 --> 00:15:00,610
You're being overly attentive
for no reason.

241
00:15:04,120 --> 00:15:05,480
What exactly do you want?

242
00:15:05,480 --> 00:15:07,410
You're not trying
to borrow money, are you?

243
00:15:07,410 --> 00:15:08,510
I've drunk the milk,

244
00:15:08,510 --> 00:15:09,650
but I have no money in my pockets.

245
00:15:09,650 --> 00:15:11,110
Let me tell you that first.

246
00:15:13,030 --> 00:15:14,720
It's not about money.

247
00:15:15,220 --> 00:15:16,080
Then what is it?

248
00:15:17,600 --> 00:15:18,270
Li,

249
00:15:18,540 --> 00:15:19,660
about Yunyi,

250
00:15:19,680 --> 00:15:21,340
can you keep it a secret for me?

251
00:15:21,370 --> 00:15:22,630
Don't tell Mom and Dad.

252
00:15:23,100 --> 00:15:23,700
Besides,

253
00:15:23,700 --> 00:15:24,740
there's nothing going on between us.

254
00:15:24,740 --> 00:15:26,130
We're just studying together

255
00:15:26,130 --> 00:15:27,080
and helping each other out.

256
00:15:27,080 --> 00:15:28,480
There better be nothing.

257
00:15:29,120 --> 00:15:30,170
I'll see how you behave.

258
00:15:30,170 --> 00:15:31,830
Go back to your room and sleep.

259
00:15:32,890 --> 00:15:33,410
Okay.

260
00:15:36,270 --> 00:15:37,200
I borrowed VR equipment

261
00:15:37,200 --> 00:15:38,130
from my colleague.

262
00:15:38,130 --> 00:15:39,120
He'll bring it tomorrow

263
00:15:39,120 --> 00:15:40,250
for you to play with.

264
00:15:41,440 --> 00:15:42,240
VR equipment?

265
00:15:42,770 --> 00:15:43,630
What kind?

266
00:15:43,650 --> 00:15:44,860
The fun kind.

267
00:15:44,860 --> 00:15:45,480
When the time comes,

268
00:15:45,480 --> 00:15:46,910
I might need you to appear

269
00:15:46,910 --> 00:15:47,860
in a video.

270
00:15:48,650 --> 00:15:49,750
I knew it.

271
00:15:50,120 --> 00:15:51,010
I was wondering why you were suddenly

272
00:15:51,010 --> 00:15:52,360
so nice to your own brother.

273
00:15:52,360 --> 00:15:54,030
You had an ulterior motive.

274
00:15:54,460 --> 00:15:55,360
You may leave.

275
00:15:56,360 --> 00:15:56,940
Okay.

276
00:17:00,740 --> 00:17:02,340
Heart-shaped.

277
00:17:05,109 --> 00:17:05,970
Strawberries?

278
00:17:06,020 --> 00:17:06,510
Give me one.

279
00:17:06,510 --> 00:17:07,910
Did you clean the toilet?

280
00:17:07,920 --> 00:17:09,329
I scrubbed it 3 times.

281
00:17:09,329 --> 00:17:10,030
Yun Ye!

282
00:17:10,880 --> 00:17:12,069
The toilets in five-star hotels

283
00:17:12,069 --> 00:17:12,900
aren't as clean as ours.

284
00:17:12,900 --> 00:17:14,630
Try shoving it in my face again.

285
00:17:15,550 --> 00:17:16,770
There's even a heart-shaped one.

286
00:17:16,770 --> 00:17:18,160
These are for our guest.

287
00:17:19,010 --> 00:17:20,349
Can the guest eat a whole plate?

288
00:17:20,349 --> 00:17:21,310
What's wrong with me eating two?

289
00:17:21,310 --> 00:17:22,050
No way.

290
00:17:22,810 --> 00:17:24,349
I'm going to take out the trash now.

291
00:17:24,349 --> 00:17:25,750
If one strawberry is missing,

292
00:17:25,750 --> 00:17:27,349
I'll stuff you in the toilet.

293
00:17:45,280 --> 00:17:46,530
It's just strawberries.

294
00:17:46,530 --> 00:17:48,730
It's not like I haven't had them before.

295
00:17:59,660 --> 00:18:00,460
Fu Shize.

296
00:18:00,740 --> 00:18:01,300
Morning.

297
00:18:01,320 --> 00:18:03,580
You're here so early.

298
00:18:04,310 --> 00:18:05,570
Why didn't you come in?

299
00:18:06,700 --> 00:18:07,550
I woke up early,

300
00:18:07,550 --> 00:18:09,150
so I just came straight here.

301
00:18:09,590 --> 00:18:10,850
How long have you been waiting outside?

302
00:18:10,850 --> 00:18:12,050
Are you cold?

303
00:18:12,720 --> 00:18:13,510
I'm fine.

304
00:18:16,480 --> 00:18:17,700
Come in with me.

305
00:18:18,160 --> 00:18:18,660
Mm.

306
00:18:27,240 --> 00:18:28,970
I'll get you a pair of slippers.

307
00:18:31,900 --> 00:18:32,430
Thanks.

308
00:18:32,640 --> 00:18:33,110
Yun Li,

309
00:18:33,480 --> 00:18:35,280
about the money for cleaning...

310
00:18:39,320 --> 00:18:39,850
Li,

311
00:18:39,900 --> 00:18:41,200
isn't this the guy

312
00:18:41,200 --> 00:18:42,660
in your high school photo?

313
00:18:44,830 --> 00:18:45,630
Yun Ye.

314
00:18:49,880 --> 00:18:50,500
Hello.

315
00:18:51,010 --> 00:18:51,900
I'm Fu Shize.

316
00:18:52,510 --> 00:18:54,070
Hello, I'm Yun Ye.

317
00:18:56,160 --> 00:18:58,490
You probably mistook me for someone else.

318
00:19:01,800 --> 00:19:02,560
Sorry about that.

319
00:19:02,560 --> 00:19:04,020
I must have been mistaken.

320
00:19:04,210 --> 00:19:05,160
After I looked closely,

321
00:19:05,160 --> 00:19:06,890
you're completely different.

322
00:19:10,180 --> 00:19:11,220
Besides, my sister

323
00:19:11,220 --> 00:19:12,610
never pursues anyone.

324
00:19:18,700 --> 00:19:19,160
I...

325
00:19:19,160 --> 00:19:19,550
Shize,

326
00:19:19,550 --> 00:19:21,280
I'll go get you a glass of water.

327
00:19:24,720 --> 00:19:25,590
Sit here.

328
00:19:31,890 --> 00:19:33,630
Just connect it to this TV.

329
00:19:34,010 --> 00:19:34,500
Mm.

330
00:19:35,530 --> 00:19:36,630
What's the Wi-Fi password?

331
00:19:36,630 --> 00:19:38,830
Yunyebielian (Yun Ye, don't connect).

332
00:19:41,010 --> 00:19:43,200
The password is in lowercase pinyin.

333
00:19:44,090 --> 00:19:44,890
You go ahead.

334
00:19:48,380 --> 00:19:49,220
You're good here.

335
00:19:49,220 --> 00:19:50,330
Hurry back to your room.

336
00:19:50,330 --> 00:19:51,030
Li,

337
00:19:51,290 --> 00:19:53,520
is that my future brother-in-law?

338
00:19:53,850 --> 00:19:55,380
What are you talking about?

339
00:19:55,660 --> 00:19:56,460
Go upstairs.

340
00:19:56,700 --> 00:19:57,480
Well...

341
00:19:57,660 --> 00:19:58,350
Get out.

342
00:19:59,560 --> 00:20:00,310
Okay, okay.

343
00:20:02,660 --> 00:20:03,000
Shize,

344
00:20:03,000 --> 00:20:04,330
I'll go study in my room.

345
00:20:30,500 --> 00:20:31,610
What's wrong?

346
00:20:35,110 --> 00:20:35,770
Nothing.

347
00:20:36,680 --> 00:20:38,010
Have you had breakfast?

348
00:20:38,590 --> 00:20:39,090
Mm.

349
00:20:50,310 --> 00:20:51,910
The photo he just mentioned—

350
00:20:52,090 --> 00:20:53,020
what photo is it?

351
00:20:55,420 --> 00:20:56,220
I washed some strawberries.

352
00:20:56,220 --> 00:20:57,030
Have some.

353
00:20:58,850 --> 00:20:59,510
No, thanks.

354
00:21:09,980 --> 00:21:11,000
Can we play now?

355
00:21:14,530 --> 00:21:16,310
We'll record a segment together later.

356
00:21:16,310 --> 00:21:16,810
And then I'll...

357
00:21:16,810 --> 00:21:18,340
I'll record a solo segment.

358
00:21:18,380 --> 00:21:19,030
What?

359
00:21:19,030 --> 00:21:19,920
Speak slower.

360
00:21:20,170 --> 00:21:20,960
I said

361
00:21:21,610 --> 00:21:22,640
we'll record a segment together.

362
00:21:22,640 --> 00:21:24,610
And then I'll record a solo segment.

363
00:21:24,610 --> 00:21:25,420
Okay, okay, okay.

364
00:21:25,420 --> 00:21:25,960
Come on.

365
00:21:31,550 --> 00:21:31,880
Yun Ye,

366
00:21:31,880 --> 00:21:33,740
you know how to operate it, right?

367
00:21:34,200 --> 00:21:34,920
I think so.

368
00:21:35,680 --> 00:21:36,260
Is it okay?

369
00:21:36,260 --> 00:21:36,720
Yes.

370
00:21:37,140 --> 00:21:37,740
It's fine.

371
00:21:44,400 --> 00:21:45,810
This is so cool.

372
00:21:46,500 --> 00:21:48,430
As expected of the latest version.

373
00:21:48,720 --> 00:21:50,520
Yun Li, which one are we playing?

374
00:21:52,980 --> 00:21:53,940
Choose the hardest one.

375
00:21:53,680 --> 00:21:56,490
♪ I look up at the sky ♪

376
00:21:54,440 --> 00:21:55,440
Sure, no problem.

377
00:21:57,250 --> 00:21:59,900
♪ And there you are, always by my side ♪

378
00:22:00,700 --> 00:22:03,110
♪ Since when did it begin? ♪

379
00:22:03,130 --> 00:22:06,330
♪ I can't quite recall ♪

380
00:22:07,240 --> 00:22:10,330
♪ You became the clouds in my dreams ♪

381
00:22:09,350 --> 00:22:10,240
Okay.

382
00:22:10,820 --> 00:22:12,980
♪ Silent and weightless ♪

383
00:22:12,240 --> 00:22:12,740
Come on.

384
00:22:13,250 --> 00:22:16,290
♪ I wish I could stay ♪

385
00:22:16,990 --> 00:22:20,290
♪ Walking by your side forever ♪

386
00:22:18,090 --> 00:22:18,820
Let's start.

387
00:22:18,980 --> 00:22:19,530
Come on.

388
00:22:21,860 --> 00:22:24,790
♪ Through seasons of endless change ♪

389
00:22:24,810 --> 00:22:26,970
♪ Through tides that ebb and flow ♪

390
00:22:28,850 --> 00:22:31,800
♪ Letting moments overlap ♪

391
00:22:31,820 --> 00:22:34,110
♪ As we feel the world transform ♪

392
00:22:35,190 --> 00:22:38,760
♪ I'm just glad I was brave enough ♪

393
00:22:38,930 --> 00:22:41,790
♪ To meet the moon ♪

394
00:22:40,940 --> 00:22:41,400
This is a bit...

395
00:22:41,400 --> 00:22:42,270
a bit scary.

396
00:22:41,820 --> 00:22:44,750
♪ Gently, I pluck a piece of it ♪

397
00:22:42,700 --> 00:22:43,290
That's why

398
00:22:43,290 --> 00:22:44,880
you should stand in front of me.

399
00:22:44,770 --> 00:22:47,660
♪ And let loneliness fade away ♪

400
00:22:47,500 --> 00:22:48,610
Careful, careful.

401
00:22:47,690 --> 00:22:51,850
♪ All I want is to be with you ♪

402
00:22:48,610 --> 00:22:49,270
Yun Ye, Yun Ye,

403
00:22:49,270 --> 00:22:50,240
pick that up for me.

404
00:22:50,240 --> 00:22:50,790
Hurry.

405
00:22:50,790 --> 00:22:51,440
Right.

406
00:22:52,170 --> 00:22:55,040
♪ That's the only thing that matters ♪

407
00:22:55,150 --> 00:22:58,890
♪ Love gives us all ♪

408
00:22:58,530 --> 00:22:59,530
This game is addictive!

409
00:22:58,910 --> 00:23:01,970
♪ Like the moon lighting up every night ♪

410
00:23:01,990 --> 00:23:02,810
♪ You know ♪

411
00:23:02,830 --> 00:23:06,070
♪ I want to fall in love with you ♪

412
00:23:05,250 --> 00:23:06,050
Is it fun?

413
00:23:06,090 --> 00:23:08,900
♪ No matter how many times I say
I love you ♪

414
00:23:07,110 --> 00:23:08,050
It's pretty fun.

415
00:23:08,180 --> 00:23:09,400
It's just a bit scary.

416
00:23:08,920 --> 00:23:12,500
♪ Clouds, please drift a little closer ♪

417
00:23:10,590 --> 00:23:11,790
Have some strawberries.

418
00:23:11,790 --> 00:23:12,310
Okay.

419
00:23:13,400 --> 00:23:18,300
♪ I could say it ten thousand times
and never tire ♪

420
00:23:13,500 --> 00:23:14,330
Have a seat.

421
00:23:26,180 --> 00:23:27,740
He's so handsome.

422
00:23:27,840 --> 00:23:30,970
It would be nice if he could
really be my brother-in-law.

423
00:23:35,220 --> 00:23:36,880
Is there something on my face?

424
00:23:37,180 --> 00:23:37,980
No.

425
00:23:48,070 --> 00:23:48,660
Shize,

426
00:23:49,590 --> 00:23:51,200
are you from XUST?

427
00:23:52,000 --> 00:23:52,570
Mm.

428
00:23:56,610 --> 00:23:57,640
How do you know?

429
00:23:58,100 --> 00:23:59,830
My sister mentioned it before.

430
00:24:00,740 --> 00:24:01,940
Have you been to XUST?

431
00:24:02,510 --> 00:24:04,440
My sister took me there a few times.

432
00:24:05,010 --> 00:24:06,220
To visit?

433
00:24:06,310 --> 00:24:07,980
No, to look for someone.

434
00:24:08,310 --> 00:24:09,030
My sister said

435
00:24:09,030 --> 00:24:10,290
she had a friend there.

436
00:24:10,360 --> 00:24:12,090
Then we read books there

437
00:24:12,680 --> 00:24:14,540
and watched a drone competition.

438
00:24:15,940 --> 00:24:17,800
You watched a drone competition?

439
00:24:17,940 --> 00:24:18,570
Yeah.

440
00:24:18,570 --> 00:24:19,570
It was super cool.

441
00:24:19,570 --> 00:24:21,630
I want to fly drones in the future too.

442
00:24:23,550 --> 00:24:24,030
Mm.

443
00:24:24,420 --> 00:24:25,220
That's great.

444
00:24:26,610 --> 00:24:29,330
But there are some problems

445
00:24:29,330 --> 00:24:30,380
I can't figure out,

446
00:24:30,380 --> 00:24:32,000
and my classmates don't understand either.

447
00:24:32,000 --> 00:24:33,590
Who should I ask, Shize?

448
00:24:34,260 --> 00:24:35,350
I'm quite familiar

449
00:24:35,380 --> 00:24:36,530
with drones.

450
00:24:36,920 --> 00:24:37,640
If there's anything you don't understand,

451
00:24:37,640 --> 00:24:38,970
you can ask me directly.

452
00:24:39,220 --> 00:24:40,330
Really, Shize?

453
00:24:40,440 --> 00:24:42,170
Let's add each other on WeChat.

454
00:24:43,720 --> 00:24:44,920
That's for biting me.

455
00:24:45,010 --> 00:24:46,210
That's for biting me.

456
00:24:49,180 --> 00:24:49,750
Shize,

457
00:24:49,750 --> 00:24:51,750
I want to go to XUST in the future too.

458
00:24:52,030 --> 00:24:53,490
Are you a science student?

459
00:24:53,830 --> 00:24:54,830
Yes, I am.

460
00:24:54,950 --> 00:24:55,530
XUST's

461
00:24:55,550 --> 00:24:57,330
Measurement and Control Technology
and Instruments,

462
00:24:57,330 --> 00:24:58,140
Information Engineering,

463
00:24:58,140 --> 00:25:00,400
and Systems Science are all pretty good.

464
00:25:03,740 --> 00:25:05,090
How about Automation?

465
00:25:05,110 --> 00:25:05,940
It's also pretty good.

466
00:25:05,940 --> 00:25:07,400
My sister is in that major.

467
00:25:10,350 --> 00:25:10,900
Mm.

468
00:25:11,530 --> 00:25:12,090
Shize,

469
00:25:12,480 --> 00:25:14,210
my sister is a very good person.

470
00:25:14,640 --> 00:25:15,180
Mm.

471
00:25:15,940 --> 00:25:17,270
She's really great.

472
00:25:17,270 --> 00:25:18,530
Really, really great.

473
00:25:22,770 --> 00:25:24,090
This is a bit hard.

474
00:25:27,700 --> 00:25:28,090
Yun Ye,

475
00:25:28,090 --> 00:25:29,470
didn't you say you had a lot of homework?

476
00:25:29,470 --> 00:25:30,730
Why are you still here?

477
00:25:30,750 --> 00:25:31,700
She's really, really...

478
00:25:31,700 --> 00:25:32,250
Go upstairs.

479
00:25:32,250 --> 00:25:32,650
Go.

480
00:25:34,440 --> 00:25:35,510
What did you say to Fu Shize?

481
00:25:35,510 --> 00:25:36,910
Did you spill my secrets?

482
00:25:37,210 --> 00:25:38,080
No.

483
00:25:38,970 --> 00:25:40,900
I was putting in a good word for you.

484
00:25:41,030 --> 00:25:41,720
You?

485
00:25:43,480 --> 00:25:44,220
Really.

486
00:25:44,220 --> 00:25:45,420
I swear to God.

487
00:25:47,570 --> 00:25:48,590
You'd better be.

488
00:26:03,770 --> 00:26:05,430
Did you eat the strawberries?

489
00:26:07,250 --> 00:26:07,750
No.

490
00:26:18,280 --> 00:26:18,750
Did you eat

491
00:26:18,750 --> 00:26:19,750
my strawberries?

492
00:26:20,180 --> 00:26:21,050
There were so many.

493
00:26:21,050 --> 00:26:22,050
How would I know?

494
00:26:22,440 --> 00:26:24,030
T-The one on top

495
00:26:24,680 --> 00:26:25,740
with a heart shape.

496
00:26:26,070 --> 00:26:27,740
I don't know which one,

497
00:26:27,740 --> 00:26:29,310
but I ate a lot.

498
00:26:29,740 --> 00:26:30,270
Yun Ye,

499
00:26:30,270 --> 00:26:31,830
you really piss me off!

500
00:26:32,680 --> 00:26:33,480
Don't even think about

501
00:26:33,480 --> 00:26:34,410
eating the rest.

502
00:26:35,220 --> 00:26:36,510
Even a stranger I just met

503
00:26:36,510 --> 00:26:37,980
knows to give your brother strawberries.

504
00:26:37,980 --> 00:26:38,420
Yun Li,

505
00:26:38,420 --> 00:26:40,090
you've been my sister for 16 years.

506
00:26:40,090 --> 00:26:42,140
Why don't you have any self-awareness?

507
00:26:42,140 --> 00:26:42,880
No, you...

508
00:27:25,120 --> 00:27:26,340
Are you leaving?

509
00:27:27,440 --> 00:27:27,980
Mm.

510
00:27:28,030 --> 00:27:29,050
I'll walk you out.

511
00:28:14,380 --> 00:28:15,420
Are you okay?

512
00:28:17,000 --> 00:28:18,000
What's wrong?

513
00:28:21,810 --> 00:28:22,700
Stomachache?

514
00:28:24,600 --> 00:28:26,260
I'll take you to the hospital.

515
00:28:28,720 --> 00:28:29,520
No need.

516
00:28:31,850 --> 00:28:32,720
I'm used to it.

517
00:28:33,660 --> 00:28:34,990
It'll be fine in a while.

518
00:28:44,250 --> 00:28:45,660
Are you feeling better?

519
00:28:50,400 --> 00:28:51,900
Can I take you

520
00:28:51,900 --> 00:28:53,420
to the hospital now?

521
00:28:55,530 --> 00:28:56,930
Take me back to the hotel.

522
00:28:58,680 --> 00:29:00,140
I need to sleep for a while.

523
00:29:22,090 --> 00:29:23,200
Dad, time to eat!

524
00:29:24,420 --> 00:29:25,290
Next time,

525
00:29:25,290 --> 00:29:26,270
tell me earlier.

526
00:29:26,610 --> 00:29:27,460
It makes things

527
00:29:27,460 --> 00:29:28,160
too stressful.

528
00:29:28,160 --> 00:29:28,850
Thanks for your hard work, Mom.

529
00:29:28,850 --> 00:29:29,460
Right.

530
00:29:29,460 --> 00:29:29,960
Yeah.

531
00:29:36,750 --> 00:29:37,660
This Li

532
00:29:38,550 --> 00:29:40,200
has requested leave at such short notice.

533
00:29:40,200 --> 00:29:40,960
Where am I supposed

534
00:29:40,960 --> 00:29:42,420
to find a replacement now?

535
00:29:42,750 --> 00:29:44,480
Then discuss it with him again.

536
00:29:44,790 --> 00:29:45,610
Forget it.

537
00:29:46,190 --> 00:29:49,260
Li's daughter is taking
the college entrance exam next year.

538
00:29:49,260 --> 00:29:50,920
While he can still manage her,

539
00:29:51,840 --> 00:29:53,060
he should do it now.

540
00:29:53,720 --> 00:29:55,760
Soon she'll be far away,

541
00:29:56,350 --> 00:29:59,210
and he won't be able to manage her
even if he wants to.

542
00:30:01,460 --> 00:30:02,860
I'll have a shrimp first.

543
00:30:02,920 --> 00:30:03,980
What are you doing?

544
00:30:04,660 --> 00:30:05,900
So eager to eat?

545
00:30:09,500 --> 00:30:10,740
What did you do at home today?

546
00:30:10,740 --> 00:30:11,800
Studied hard.

547
00:30:12,310 --> 00:30:14,250
I didn't even leave my room.

548
00:30:18,500 --> 00:30:19,290
Yun Li,

549
00:30:19,810 --> 00:30:20,660
did you make your brother

550
00:30:20,660 --> 00:30:22,260
help you shoot a video today?

551
00:30:25,790 --> 00:30:26,590
Your brother is taking
the college entrance exam next year.

552
00:30:26,590 --> 00:30:27,790
You know that, right?

553
00:30:28,790 --> 00:30:29,460
It's fine if you

554
00:30:29,460 --> 00:30:30,860
mess around by yourself.

555
00:30:30,900 --> 00:30:31,720
Why are you dragging your brother

556
00:30:31,720 --> 00:30:32,850
into your nonsense?

557
00:30:34,270 --> 00:30:35,030
Lili finally

558
00:30:35,050 --> 00:30:35,900
came home.

559
00:30:35,900 --> 00:30:37,830
Let's talk about something happy.

560
00:30:42,460 --> 00:30:44,860
I told you not to go
to Nanwu for grad school,

561
00:30:45,090 --> 00:30:45,810
right?

562
00:30:45,810 --> 00:30:47,540
You just did it without asking.

563
00:30:47,590 --> 00:30:48,790
Now that you're back,

564
00:30:48,900 --> 00:30:49,660
you're dragging your brother

565
00:30:49,660 --> 00:30:50,590
to shoot videos.

566
00:30:51,750 --> 00:30:52,160
Well,

567
00:30:52,160 --> 00:30:53,250
are you really planning

568
00:30:53,250 --> 00:30:54,450
to support yourself?

569
00:30:55,350 --> 00:30:55,810
Dad,

570
00:30:55,810 --> 00:30:57,340
I just appeared on camera today.

571
00:30:57,340 --> 00:30:58,510
I didn't do anything else,

572
00:30:58,510 --> 00:30:59,850
and it didn't delay my studies.

573
00:30:59,850 --> 00:31:00,700
Shut up.

574
00:31:02,610 --> 00:31:04,400
How many times have I told you?

575
00:31:04,750 --> 00:31:05,590
I told you to come back to Xifu

576
00:31:05,590 --> 00:31:07,290
and find a proper job.

577
00:31:07,350 --> 00:31:08,250
But you

578
00:31:08,610 --> 00:31:10,340
just do useless things all day.

579
00:31:10,660 --> 00:31:11,090
Right.

580
00:31:11,980 --> 00:31:13,640
You've been a content creator

581
00:31:13,790 --> 00:31:15,010
for a few years now.

582
00:31:15,010 --> 00:31:16,400
What have you achieved?

583
00:31:17,420 --> 00:31:18,660
As a girl,

584
00:31:19,000 --> 00:31:20,700
you shoot videos
and post them online all day.

585
00:31:20,700 --> 00:31:21,460
You just let people

586
00:31:21,460 --> 00:31:22,290
judge you.

587
00:31:22,290 --> 00:31:23,350
Aren't you ashamed?

588
00:31:23,350 --> 00:31:23,680
Wait,

589
00:31:23,680 --> 00:31:25,420
